### Step 5: C golden data generator

`tests/c-gen/gen_moshier_moon.c` — calls `swi_moshmoon2()` at 11 test epochs (9 matching planet tests + 2 Moon-specific: half-day offset and ~1 sidereal month):

```c
static double epochs[] = {
    2451545.0 - 3000.0*365.25, 2451545.0 - 1000.0*365.25,
    2451545.0 - 500.0*365.25,  2451545.0 - 100.0*365.25,
    2451545.0,                  2451545.0 + 100.0*365.25,
    2451545.0 + 500.0*365.25,  2451545.0 + 1000.0*365.25,
    2451545.0 + 999.0*365.25,
    2451545.0 + 0.5,            // half day offset
    2451545.0 + 27.3,           // ~1 sidereal month
};
```

Compile: `cc -Wall -I../../swisseph gen_moshier_moon.c ../../swisseph/libswe.a -lm`

